# mdview — C++20 Terminal Markdown Viewer

A terminal Markdown workspace: file tree on the left, rendered document on the
right. Native C++20, zero dependencies, one CMake build.

## Context

You are working on **mdview**, a cross-platform terminal Markdown viewer written
in modern C++20. The project has zero third-party dependencies and builds with
CMake on Windows (MSVC), Linux (GCC/Clang), and macOS (Clang).

